We are hiring: Equity Analyst – Asian Equities
A leading investment firm is looking for an Equity Analyst to join our Equity team in Hong Kong.
- Conduct fundamental research on Asian equities, with a focus on the financial sector;
- Minimum 2 years of relevant equity research experience, preferably covering financials;
- Bachelor’s degree or above; accounting, audit experience and/or CFA preferred;
- Fluent in English and Chinese

Interested candidates are welcome to apply or reach out for more details.
